<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. With this, the Meicho Arc [Clear Sign] is over.<PG>
You have not yet viewed every scenario of the Meicho Arc [Clear Sign], but that is for another occasion.<PG>
The culprit of the Megasawa City case, and the mysteries of the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] as well, seem to have been largely solved, but some mysteries still remain.<PG>
In the end, the incident occurred in Megasawa City, and Ryoji Kogori was murdered.<PG>
How could this tragedy have been prevented? 
{PAUSE ""}
To know that, it seems we will need to learn about the parents of Natsumi Kogori and Haruka Niimura―about their past.<PG>
Now then, from here on, let us go far back in time.<PG>
Yes, we will uncover what happened in Megasawa City, as well as the reason Ryoji Kogori was murdered and the crime that seemed like a spiriting away.
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
